<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand rises to $43.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand rises to $43.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's central bank on Thursday announced sales of foreign exchange at its latest weekly auction held on Wednesday as follows:</p>
<p>				     30		 24 July</p>
<p>		  Amount sold $43.632	   $31.106 million</p>
<p>     Dollar exchange rate  83.00	    83.20 naira</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
